# One extended regex per line; matched case-insensitively and removed from a
# line before the forbidden-token check runs. Every entry needs a reason.
# Click Shop API names its order-id field this way (Prepare/Complete, M3).
merchant_trans_id
# The public API's refund reason for a market's refusal (spec 2026-10-09 §5, a closed
# contract list partners code against).
supplier_refused
